  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Trauma Relief for Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to strengthen collaboration between the Danish trauma center CTTT and the Ukrainian Trauma Healing Institute (&#x406;&#x43d;&#x441;&#x442;&#x438;&#x442;&#x443;&#x442; &#x417;&#x446;&#x456;&#x43b;&#x435;&#x43d;&#x43d;&#x44f; &#x422;&#x440;&#x430;&#x432;&#x43c;), while training nine Ukrainian staff members in moral injury. Training materials in biblical pastoral care will be developed for participant and facilitator guides. The overall goal is to help address the severe trauma experienced by the Ukrainian population, with resources that recognize the importance of faith.</narrative>
  </description>
